# Authorization

CASL + RBAC permission strings `{resource}.{action}`.

- Ability rules in `@zarva/shared` via `createAppAbility`
- Never duplicate ability logic outside shared
- Nest: PoliciesGuard + service re-check for money/stock
- FE: `@casl/react` Can + sidebar/route gates
- Entitlements (plan) gate modules first; CASL gates user actions second
- SUPER_ADMIN / PLATFORM_ADMIN → manage all
